{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    with middle of the this section i need "view all products" button, i need  small cart icon button and view all products button with link
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};padding:36px 20px;overflow:hidden}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font:Georgia,serif;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);margin:0 0 18px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 2px 16px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);min-width:0;background:{{ block.settings.card_color }};border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px;overflow:hidden;scroll-snap-align:start;box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(20,45,25,.08);transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 9px 22px rgba(20,45,25,.14)}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{height:250px;position:relative;background:#f1eee6;overflow:hidden}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .3s ease}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{transform:scale(1.025)}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{height:100%;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{height:100%;width:100%}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{position:absolute;bottom:10px;color:#42564a;font-size:12px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details{padding:14px 16px 16px;position:relative;min-height:140px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{font-size:12px;color:{{ block.settings.green }};font-weight:700}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:20px Georgia,serif;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};margin:7px 44px 4px 0}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font-size:13px;color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};margin:0 36px 10px 0}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-right:38px}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font-weight:750;color:{{ block.settings.green }};font-size:17px}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{color:{{ block.settings.muted_color }};text-decoration:line-through;font-size:13px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:34px;height:34px;border:0;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:#fff;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:transform .2s ease}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart svg{width:16px;height:16px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:38px;height:38px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view{display:inline-flex;min-height:42px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.green }};color:{{ block.settings.green }};font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view:hover{background:{{ block.settings.green }};color:#fff}
.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} :focus-visible{outline:3px solid {{ block.settings.accent }};outline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:900px){.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}
@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:28px 16px}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:82%}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{height:230px}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{gap:14px;margin-right:-16px;padding-right:16px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{scroll-behavior:auto}.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card,.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img,.ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<nursery-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
{% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
{% for i in (1..6) %}
{% assign pk='product_' | append:i %}{% assign ik='image_' | append:i %}{% assign tk='title_' | append:i %}{% assign dk='description_' | append:i %}{% assign lk='link_' | append:i %}{% assign product=block.settings[pk] %}{% assign image=block.settings[ik] %}{% assign title=block.settings[tk] %}{% assign desc=block.settings[dk] %}{% assign link=block.settings[lk] %}
{% if product != blank or image != blank or title != blank %}
{% if product != blank %}{% assign title=product.title %}{% assign desc=product.description | strip_html | truncate: 72 %}{% assign link=product.url %}{% endif %}
<article class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">
{% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default:title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default:product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Choose an image in settings</span></div>{% endif %}
{% assign bestkey='bestseller_' | append:i %}{% if block.settings[bestkey] %}<span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings.bestseller_label | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__details"><span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ block.settings.rating }} | {{ block.settings.reviews }}</span><h3 class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{% if link != blank %}<a href="{{ link }}">{{ title | escape }}</a>{% else %}{{ title | escape }}{% endif %}</h3>{% if desc != blank %}<p class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ desc | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if product != blank %}<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices"><span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% if product.available %}{% assign variant=product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}<form method="post" action="/cart/add"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/cart"><button class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" type="submit" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z"></path><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"></path></svg></button></form>{% endif %}{% else %}{% assign pricekey='price_' | append:i %}{% assign comparekey='compare_price_' | append:i %}<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices"><span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ block.settings[pricekey] | escape }}</span><span class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ block.settings[comparekey] | escape }}</span></div>{% if link != blank %}<a class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" href="{{ link }}" aria-label="View {{ title | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 12H4L5 8Z"></path><path d="M9 8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"></path></svg></a>{% endif %}{% endif %}</div></article>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
<div class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer"><button class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous products">←</button>{% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_text | escape }}</a>{% endif %}<button class="ai-plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products">→</button></div>
</div></nursery-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const tag='nursery-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class NurseryProducts extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('[data-track]');this.prev=this.querySelector('[data-prev]');this.next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');if(!this.track)return;this.prev.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.next.addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1));this.track.addEventListener('scroll',()=>this.update(),{passive:true});this.observer=new ResizeObserver(()=>this.update());this.observer.observe(this.track);this.update()}disconnectedCallback(){if(this.observer)this.observer.disconnect()}move(dir){const card=this.track.querySelector('article');if(card)this.track.scrollBy({left:dir*(card.getBoundingClientRect().width+(parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap)||0)),behavior:'smooth'})}update(){const end=this.track.scrollWidth-this.track.clientWidth;this.prev.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft<=2;this.next.disabled=this.track.scrollLeft>=end-2}}customElements.define(tag,NurseryProducts)})();</script>
